<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108059" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηχέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sound in answer, echo, respond,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ δ᾽ ἤχεεν οὔρεα μακρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					835
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρρηξε δ᾽ αὐδήν, ὥσθ᾽ ὑπηχῆσαι
					χθόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					710
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστε τὴν κώμην ὑπηχεῖν</span>
			so that the village <i>rang again,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				10
			</span></i> (troch.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερινὸν ὑπηχεῖ τῷ τῶν
				τεττίγων χορῷ</span>
			<i>echoes</i> summer-like with the cicada-choir, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				230c
			</span></i>; of musical strings, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				921b15
			</span></i>: metaph., with neut. Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMar.</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαθρὸν καὶ ἀγεννές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.64e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prompt, suggest,</i> esp. of an inner voice, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.599
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				645
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				659
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				692
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάπερ ὑποβολέως ἔνδοθεν
				ὑπηχοῦντος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				416
			</span></i>.</div>
